[N 59-60 Un'Goro Crater (Horde)]
[D Shaper’s Terrace at 59, final training, Upper Blackrock Spire, Scholomance and Dire Maul West at 60. Ends in Orgrimmar.]
[GA Horde,Softcore]
[XP59] Start at Marshal's Refuge at 59 after Dire Maul North, with your Hearthstone bound to Orgrimmar. Keep the four-deed quest, Plagued Hatchlings, Egg Freezing, For The Horde, Umi's toy and any Upper Spire attunement.
Use Umi's Mechanical Yeti near Quixxil for [QC5163,3]; keep it for Umi in Everlook.
[V] Repair and restock at Marshal's Refuge before the ascent.
[G18.10,61.30 Thousand Needles] Follow the approach north from Marshal's Refuge onto the crater's raised northern terrace. Use the rising path to the titan complex entrance.
At Shaper's Terrace entrance, join a five-player party with a tank and healer.
Enter Shaper's Terrace together at 59+.
Clear Shaper's Terrace through Nanaya, completing the other encounters along the route, then leave by the cleared approach.
[XP60] Reach level 60 before final training and the last dungeon circuit. If short, return to Cenarion Hold and hunt southern Dredge Crushers or Twilight camps with a party, then use the Cenarion Hold flight point.
[L45.23,5.83 Un'Goro Crater] [L48.68,36.67 Silithus] [H Orgrimmar] [F Orgrimmar] [O] Hearth to Orgrimmar if ready; otherwise fly from Marshal's Refuge or Cenarion Hold.
[G54.10,68.41 Orgrimmar] [S Orgrimmar] Bind with Gryshka; repair and restock.
[G48.47,45.43 Orgrimmar] [T] [A Warlock] At Zevrost, learn Demon Armor V, Immolate VII, Bane of Doom, Create Healthstone V, Create Soulstone V and Create Spellstone III; learn eligible talented ranks. Learn Imp Blood Pact VI and Voidwalker Torment VI / Suffering IV. Buy and use the listed demon grimoires from Kurgul nearby.
[A Warrior] [G80.39,32.38 Orgrimmar] [T] At Sorek, learn Cleave V, Overpower IV and Rend VII.
[A Warrior] [G55.90,62.71 Orgrimmar] [LESP25286] [O] If you have Manual of Heroic Strike IX or find an affordable copy at the Auction House, use it to learn Heroic Strike IX.
[A Warrior] [G55.90,62.71 Orgrimmar] [LESP25289] [O] If you have Manual of Battle Shout VII or find an affordable copy at the Auction House, use it to learn Battle Shout VII.
[A Warrior] [G55.90,62.71 Orgrimmar] [LESP25288] [O] If you have Manual of Revenge VI or find an affordable copy at the Auction House, use it to learn Revenge VI.
[A Shaman] [G38.66,35.92 Orgrimmar] [T] At Sagorne Creststrider, learn Ancestral Spirit V, Earth Shock VII, Healing Stream Totem V, Lesser Healing Wave VI, Lightning Shield VIII, Nature Resistance Totem III, Searing Totem VI and Windfury Weapon IV.
[A Shaman] [G55.90,62.71 Orgrimmar] [LE SP25357 1] Buy and use Tablet of Healing Wave X at the Auction House if available; skip if learned or unavailable.
[A Shaman] [G55.90,62.71 Orgrimmar] [LE SP25361 1] Buy and use Tablet of Strength of Earth Totem V at the Auction House if available; skip if learned or unavailable.
[A Shaman] [G55.90,62.71 Orgrimmar] [LE SP25359 1] Buy and use Tablet of Grace of Air Totem III at the Auction House if available; skip if learned or unavailable.
[A Rogue] [G43.05,53.74 Orgrimmar] [T] At Shenthul, learn Stealth IV, Gouge V, Backstab VIII and Rupture VI.
[A Rogue] [G43.05,53.74 Orgrimmar] [T] At Shenthul, learn Instant Poison VI (280 Poisons). Learn recipes as your Poisons skill allows; skip unavailable recipes.
[A Rogue] [G42.09,49.48 Orgrimmar] [V] Buy ingredients for your usable poisons and Flash Powder from Rekkul.
[A Rogue] [G55.90,62.71 Orgrimmar] [V] Restock Blinding Powder at the Auction House, or buy Fadeleaf and make it with your learned recipe.
[A Priest] [G35.59,87.82 Orgrimmar] [T] At Ur'kyo, learn Devouring Plague VI, Divine Spirit IV, Fade VI, Holy Fire VIII, Inner Fire VI, Power Word: Fortitude VI, Power Word: Shield X, Prayer of Healing IV, Prayer of Spirit and Shackle Undead III.
[A Priest,Undead] [G35.59,87.82 Orgrimmar] [T] At Ur'kyo, learn Touch of Weakness VI and Dark Sacrifice V.
[A Priest,Troll] [G35.59,87.82 Orgrimmar] [T] At Ur'kyo, learn Hex of Weakness VI.
[A Priest,Troll] [G35.59,87.82 Orgrimmar] [T] At Ur'kyo, learn Shadowguard VI.
[A Priest] [G55.90,62.71 Orgrimmar] [LE SP21564 1] Buy and use Codex: Prayer of Fortitude II at the Auction House if available; skip if already learned or unavailable.
[A Priest] [G55.90,62.71 Orgrimmar] [LE SP27683 1] Buy and use Codex: Prayer of Shadow Protection at the Auction House if available; skip if already learned or unavailable.
[A Priest] [G45.43,56.55 Orgrimmar] [V] Buy Sacred Candles from Horthus for your group prayers.
[A Paladin] [G45.12,63.89 Orgrimmar] [F Thunder Bluff] Fly to Thunder Bluff for Paladin training.
[A Paladin] [G22.62,19.91 Thunder Bluff] [T] At Alodan the Hopeful, learn Greater Blessing of Kings, Greater Blessing of Might II, Greater Blessing of Wisdom II, Holy Strike VIII, Redemption V, Exorcism VI, Consecration V, Holy Wrath II, Hammer of Wrath III, Seal of Light IV, Devotion Aura VII and Fire Resistance Aura III.
[A Paladin] [G47.00,49.83 Thunder Bluff] [F Orgrimmar] Fly back to Orgrimmar before continuing.
[A Mage] [G38.35,85.56 Orgrimmar] [T] At Pephredo, learn Fireball XI, Frostfire Bolt III, Polymorph IV and Blizzard VI.
[A Hunter] [G66.05,18.53 Orgrimmar] [T] At Ormak Grimshot, learn Aspect of the Beast IV, Aimed Shot VI, Arcane Shot VIII, Distracting Shot VI, Freezing Trap III, Mend Pet VII and Wing Clip III.
[A Hunter] [G66.32,14.81 Orgrimmar] [T] At Xao'tsu, learn Growl VII, Great Stamina X, Natural Armor X. Open Beast Training and teach the usable ranks to your active pet as its level and training points allow.
[A Druid] [SP18960-] Cast Teleport: Moonglade for Druid training.
[A Druid] [G52.53,40.57 Moonglade] [T] At Loganaar, learn Hurricane III, Mark of the Wild VII, Prowl III, Rebirth V, Regrowth IX, Revive V, Rip VI and Tranquility IV.
[A Druid] [G44.28,45.87 Moonglade] Ask Bunthen Plainswind for the Druid flight to Thunder Bluff.
[A Druid] [G47.00,49.83 Thunder Bluff] [F Orgrimmar] Fly to Orgrimmar.
[A Druid] [G45.99,45.68 Orgrimmar] [V] Buy Ironwood Seeds from Hagrus for your new Rebirth rank.
[V] Repair, restock and train available abilities and chosen professions.
[A Warlock] Accept [QA7562].
[A Warlock] [V] Buy ten Elixirs of Shadow Power, six Large Brilliant Shards, twenty-five Dark Iron Ore, thirty-five Black Dragonscales and three Arcanite Bars at the Auction House. Keep gold for Shadowy Potions, Xorothian Stardust and Gorzeeki's three ritual items.
[A Warlock] Take the Tirisfal zeppelin outside Orgrimmar and enter Undercity by its main lifts.
[A Warlock] [G63.25,48.56 Undercity] [F Flame Crest] Fly to Flame Crest.
[A Warlock] [G12.69,31.64 Burning Steppes] Ride west to Mor'zul and Gorzeeki at the Altar of Storms.
[A Warlock] Turn in [QT7562], then accept [QA7563].
[A Warlock] Accept [QA7623].
[A Warlock] Buy Shadowy Potions from Gorzeeki Wildeyes; bring enough for the Ulathek party's Jaedenar visit. Keep the purchased mount materials in your bags.
[A Warlock] Return to Flame Crest, fly to Undercity and take the Orgrimmar zeppelin.
[G45.12,63.89 Orgrimmar] [F Everlook] Fly to Everlook for Umi's delivery.
[G60.47,36.30 Winterspring] Arrive at Everlook's Horde flight point after the flight.
Turn in [QT5163].
[A Warlock] [G63.87,61.06 Winterspring] At the Crazed Owlbeast hunting grounds, form a party for Rage of Blood.
[A Warlock] Collect thirty Raging Beast's Blood from the Crazed Owlbeasts for [QC7563]; stay clear of the southern demon camps.
[A Warlock] Return to Everlook and fly to Bloodvenom Post. [G60.47,36.30 Winterspring] [F Bloodvenom Post]
[A Warlock] Follow Felwood's main road south to Jaedenar. Drink a Shadowy Potion before entering Shadow Hold, keep it active and keep pets passive among the now-friendly demons.
[A Warlock] Turn in [QT7623], then accept [QA7624].
[A Warlock] [G35.17,59.79 Felwood] Return to Jaedenar's moonwell approach and form a party for Ulathek. Give the party its Shadowy Potions before entering.
[A Warlock] Confront Ulathek with the party, defeat him and take The Traitor's Heart for [QC7624]. Keep the Shadowy Potion effect active for the return to Banehollow.
[A Warlock] Turn in [QT7624], then accept [QA7625].
[A Warlock] Buy Xorothian Stardust from Ur'dan beside Banehollow. Leave through the same passages while the potion remains active.
[A Warlock] [L34.44,53.96 Felwood] [H Orgrimmar] [F Orgrimmar] [O] Hearth to Orgrimmar if ready; otherwise leave by the cleared passages and main road, return to Bloodvenom Post and fly.
[A Warlock] Take the Tirisfal zeppelin, fly from Undercity to Flame Crest and return west to Mor'zul and Gorzeeki at the Altar of Storms.
[A Warlock] Turn in [QT7563], then accept [QA7564].
[A Warlock] Turn in [QT7564] and [QT7625].
[A Warlock] Accept [QA7626], [QA7627] and [QA7628].
[A Warlock] Turn in [QT7626], [QT7627] and [QT7628], then accept [QA7630].
[A Warlock] Turn in [QT7630], then accept [QA7629].
[A Warlock] Keep the Imp in a Jar for Scholomance.
[G65.69,24.22 Burning Steppes] Travel to Flame Crest and repair. From Everlook, fly to Orgrimmar, take the Tirisfal zeppelin and fly from Undercity; from the Altar of Storms, follow the road east.
Travel into Blackrock Mountain and up to the Spire portal. Reach the upper wing's door.
At the upper Spire door, join a group with tanks and healers; arrange a member with the Seal of Ascension to open it.
Enter Upper Blackrock Spire together at 60. Clear the rune rooms and free Pyroguard Emberseer, then defeat him.
After clearing the Rookery safely, use the Eggscilloscope Prototype on an egg to test Egg Freezing for [QC4734]. [O]
For Thrall, defeat Solakar Flamewreath, then clear Rend's arena waves and defeat Rend; loot his head for [QC4974].
Defeat General Drakkisath and his guards with the group to finish the clear.
If carrying Blackhand's Command, touch Drakkisath's Brand behind the General to turn in [QT7761] for the attunement.
Return together to Flame Crest.
Turn in [QT4734].
[G65.69,24.22 Burning Steppes] [F Undercity] Fly to Undercity, then follow the eastern road through the Bulwark into Western Plaguelands. Continue along the farm roads to Caer Darrow.
Visit Eva Sarkhoff on Caer Darrow before entering Scholomance.
Accept [QA5382].
[A Warlock] Include Imp Delivery when arranging the Scholomance quest clear.
Join a five-player Scholomance party with a tank and healer; arrange a member with the Skeleton Key. Arrange the full quest clear, including Eva's follow-ups, Jandice and Kirtonos.
Enter Scholomance together at 60. Leave Jandice's basement and Kirtonos's balcony for their quest steps while clearing the main halls first.
Collect the four deeds: Southshore on a table in the first large room; Tarren Mill on a table before the hatchlings; Brill in Ras Frostwhisper's room; Caer Darrow in Lord Alexei Barov's room for [QC5341]. [O]
Kill twenty Plagued Hatchlings before clearing Rattlegore's room for [QC5529]. [O]
Clear Rattlegore and the path to Ras Frostwhisper, then defeat Ras.
[A Warlock] Use the Imp in a Jar at the laboratory and stay until J'eevee finishes the parchment for [QC7629].
Continue through the classroom bosses. Defeat Doctor Theolen Krastinov and burn both Sarkhoff remains in his room for [QC5382].
Defeat Darkmaster Gandling after the six lower-room bosses. Return through the cleared halls to Eva without resetting the instance.
Turn in [QT5382], then accept [QA5515].
Re-enter the same instance with the party. Clear Jandice Barov's basement, defeat her and take Krastinov's Bag of Horrors for [QC5515].
Return to Eva by the cleared halls.
Turn in [QT5515], then accept [QA5384].
Return to the same instance's balcony with the party. Place the Blood of Innocents in the brazier and defeat Kirtonos the Herald to finish the clear for [QC5384].
Leave through the cleared entrance.
Turn in [QT5384]. Keep the Spectral Essence reward for speaking to Caer Darrow's spirits.
Return west along the Plaguelands road to the Bulwark.
Turn in [QT5341].
Continue west to Undercity and use its main lifts.
[G63.25,48.56 Undercity] [F Light's Hope Chapel] Fly to Light's Hope.
Turn in [QT5529].
[A Warlock] Fly to Flame Crest and return west to Gorzeeki and Mor'zul at the Altar of Storms.
[A Warlock] Turn in [QT7629].
[A Warlock] Accept [QA7631].
[A Warlock] Buy J'eevee's Jar, Black Lodestone and Xorothian Glyphs from Gorzeeki. Read Mor'zul's Instructions.
[A Warlock] [G55.60,54.14 Burning Steppes] Use Drain Soul on Blackrock Soldiers until you carry at least twenty Soul Shards for Dire Maul's ritual.
[H Orgrimmar] [O] Hearth to Orgrimmar if ready; otherwise fly from Light's Hope to Undercity and take the Orgrimmar zeppelin. From the Altar of Storms, return to Flame Crest for the Undercity flight instead.
Turn in [QT4974] to Thrall with Rend's head and hear his proclamation.
[G45.12,63.89 Orgrimmar] [F Camp Mojache] Fly to Camp Mojache.
[A Warlock] Have all three ritual items and at least twenty Soul Shards ready for Dire Maul West.
Follow the northern path from Mojache to Dire Maul's central courtyard. Reach the western entrance.
[A Warlock] Include the Dreadsteed ritual when arranging the Dire Maul West clear.
At Dire Maul's western entrance, join a five-player party with a tank and healer. Bring the Crescent Key and unlock the wing together.
Enter Dire Maul West together at 60. Speak to the Shen'dralar Ancient above the courtyard and accept [QA7461] before continuing deeper.
Clear Tendris Warpwood and the courtyard pylon's guardians. Continue through the upper walkways, Illyanna Ravenoak and Magister Kalendris, clearing each pylon's guardians.
Reach the Prison of Immol'thar and clear the guardians of its remaining pylons. Check that all five pylons are deactivated, then defeat Immol'thar.
[A Warlock] Clear Immol'thar's prison before the Dreadsteed ritual. Use J'eevee's Jar to place the bell, wheel and candle.
[A Warlock] Defend the ritual with the party, using Black Lodestone and Soul Shards to reactivate extinguished ritual objects. Keep the tank free to gather incoming demons.
[A Warlock] When the nine summoning runes are active and the ritual is complete, use the Xorothian Glyphs. Defeat the Xorothian Dreadsteed and Lord Hel'nurath with the party for [QC7631].
[A Warlock] Turn in [QT7631] to the Dreadsteed Spirit to bind the mount and learn Summon Dreadsteed.
Continue to the Athenaeum and defeat Prince Tortheldrin to finish Dire Maul West for [QC7461].
Return to the Shen'dralar Ancient through the cleared halls. Turn in [QT7461], then accept [QA7877].
Return to the Athenaeum and turn in [QT7877] to claim the Treasure of the Shen'dralar.
[A Mage] Accept [QA7463] from Lorekeeper Lydros in the Athenaeum before leaving.
Leave through the cleared western entrance.
[A Mage] [G64.80,30.30 Feralas] Cross the central courtyard to Dire Maul East's main entrance and find a five-player party with a tank and healer for Hydrospawn.
[A Mage] Enter Dire Maul East and clear the corridors and pool approach to Hydrospawn. Defeat him and take the Hydrospawn Essence for [QC7463].
[A Mage] Leave by the cleared eastern entrance. Return to the Athenaeum through its outer access door, using the Crescent Key.
[A Mage] Turn in [QT7463] to Lorekeeper Lydros and learn Conjure Water VII.
[L75.45,44.36 Feralas] [H Orgrimmar] [F Orgrimmar] [O] Hearth to Orgrimmar if ready; otherwise return east by road to Camp Mojache and fly.
[A Paladin,Undead] Leave Orgrimmar by the main gate and take the Tirisfal zeppelin for your epic class mount.
[A Paladin,Undead] [G21.95,46.94 Tirisfal Glades] Follow the western road to Bandarion Keep and speak with Hilda the Breaker about the Charger quest.
[A Paladin,Undead] Complete Justice and Retribution, following your class quest's objectives, preparation and turn-ins. Learn Summon Forsaken Charger.
[A Paladin,Undead] Return along the road to the Tirisfal zeppelin and take it back to Orgrimmar.
Finish in Orgrimmar at level 60 with the full dungeon journey complete.
